#     free-form name/value pairs a script or 3rd-party tool can set on a
#     device — e.g. a patch-compliance scanner writing "PatchLevel": "12.1").
#   - customField: a dot-path into the full normalized device record, for any
#     attribute that doesn't have a dedicated catalog entry (e.g. "model",
